{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"00eeb1b0-20c9-45ce-b13b-8b2de5355fe7","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have Q1.4:\n\n**问题**: 在单请求场景下，多算子/微算子并发的算法层面可行性如何？\n\n**预关键词**: 算子并发, operator concurrency, 微算子, micro-operator, 数据依赖分析, data dependency analysis, DAG调度, DAG scheduling, 计算图切分, computation graph partitioning, expert并行, expert parallelism, all-to-all通信, all-reduce overlap, attention head并行, multi-head parallel, FFN并行, FFN parallelism, 流水线并行, pipeline parallelism, wavefront scheduling, diffusion去噪并发, denoising concurrency, 模态并行编码, modality-parallel encoding, spatial-temporal并行, spatial-temporal parallelism, 片上存储划分, on-chip memory partitioning, 并发调度, concurrent scheduling, control logic, 硬件并发能力, hardware concurrency capacity\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Semantic segmentation of the question\n2. Search across 4 directories for each keyword group\n3. Read the top 15-20 notes\n4. Write the answer\n\nLet me first do semantic segmentation of the question:\n\nThe question has these sub-questions:\n1. MoE中多个expert FFN可并行计算 + all-to-all通信可与其他计算overlap\n2. DiT中diffusion step内部多个attention head和FFN的并发机会 + denoising step间是否存在可流水线的算子\n3. 多模态中vision encoder和text encoder的并行编码 + 跨模态融合时的算子级并发\n4. Video中spatial stream和temporal stream的并行处理 + 多帧/多patch的独立编码并发\n5. 从数据依赖DAG出发分析哪些算子可并发、哪些必须串行\n6. 结合侧重标签分析并发对硬件体系结构的要求\n\nLet me create keyword groups for each sub-question and search in parallel.\n\nKeyword groups:\n1. MoE expert parallel: expert parallelism, MoE FFN concurrent, all-to-all overlap, expert routing concurrent\n2. DiT diffusion concurrent: DiT attention head parallel, diffusion step pipeline, denoising concurrency\n3. Multimodal encoder parallel: vision text encoder parallel, modality-parallel encoding, cross-modal fusion concurrent\n4. Video spatial temporal parallel: spatial temporal stream parallel, video frame patch parallel encoding\n5. DAG scheduling: data dependency DAG, operator concurrency, computation graph partitioning\n6. Hardware concurrency: on-chip memory partitioning, concurrent scheduling hardware, SM partition\n\nLet me search across all four directories. But first, let me do the searches efficiently. I'll use multiple parallel search calls.\n\nLet me organize the search into batches. Each batch will search one keyword across all 4 directories.\n\nKey keywords to search:\n- expert parallelism\n- MoE all-to-all\n- operator concurrency\n- attention head parallel\n- diffusion step pipeline\n- modality-parallel encoding\n- spatial-temporal parallel\n- DAG scheduling\n- on-chip memory partitioning\n- FFN parallelism\n- pipeline parallelism\n- denoising concurrency\n- video frame parallel\n- wavefront scheduling\n- micro-operator\n- hardware concurrency\n\nI'll batch these into groups and search across the 4 directories. The omnisearch mode uses path: prefix in the query string itself.\n\nLet me do this in parallel. I'll search 4 keywords at a time, each across all 4 directories. That means 16 searches per batch.\n\nActually, let me be more strategic. Let me search with broader queries first.","signature":"00eeb1b0-20c9-45ce-b13b-8b2de5355fe7"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23799,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4dfa4c7f-8d75-4afe-a082-3ffb275c3ba3","uuid":"953dd909-7284-449a-9157-e533e4b2712d"}
