\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Modality Alignment (跨模态对齐).md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Modality Alignment (跨模态对齐)\",\"score\":551.0503788719616,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"cross-modality\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Modality\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modality\",\"offset\":82},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1401}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Modality Alignment (跨模态对齐)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCross-Modality Alignment（跨模态对齐）是多模态大模型训练的第一阶段（Alignment Stage），目标是将不同模态（图像、视频、音频、语音等）的编码器输出映射到统一的 LLM 语言表示空间，使 LLM 能\\\"理解\\\"非文本模态的输入。该阶段仅训练模态连接器（Connector），冻结编码器和 LLM，通过最小化生成文本的交叉熵损失来学习模态-语言映射。\\nUni-MoE 的跨模态对齐阶段针对每种模态独立执行：(1)…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Self Pruning (CSP) _ Cross-Self Attention Decomposition for VLM KV Cache.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Self Pruning (CSP) _ Cross-Self Attention Decomposition for VLM KV Cache\",\"score\":481.1987666168537,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross_ratio=0.5。在\",\"cross-attention。然后在\",\"cross-attention；\",\"cross-attention\",\"cross-self\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":30},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":113},{\"match\":\"cross-attention；\",\"offset\":394},{\"match\":\"cross-attention。然后在\",\"offset\":445},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":471},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":526},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":848},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.5。在\",\"offset\":1505},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":1620}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Self Pruning (CSP) / Cross-Self Attention Decomposition for VLM KV Cache\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nCross-Self Pruning (CSP) 是一种 training-free 的 KV Cache 剪枝方法，专为多模态视觉语言模型（VLM）设计。核心创新是将原始注意力矩阵 A ∈ [0,1]^{L×L}（L = L_t + L_v，文本+视觉 token 长度）分解为四个子区域：(a) A^{st} ∈ [0,1]^{L_t×L_t}：文本→文本 self-atte…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture（基于交叉注意力的多模态大语言模型架构）.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture（基于交叉注意力的多模态大语言模型架构）\",\"score\":425.7384893586021,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attend\",\"cross-attention）、idefics、evlm\",\"cross-attention（flamingo\",\"cross-attention-based\",\"cross-attention\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":234},{\"match\":\"cross-attention）、IDEFICS、EVLM\",\"offset\":294},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention-based\",\"offset\":961},{\"match\":\"cross-attend\",\"offset\":1058},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1219},{\"match\":\"cross-attention（Flamingo\",\"offset\":1291},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1544},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":1740}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture（基于交叉注意力的多模态大语言模型架构）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\n基于交叉注意力的 MLLM 架构是多模态大语言模型的三大架构范式之一（另两种为 Concatenation-based 和 Q-Former/Token Compression-based）。核心特征是视觉特征不直接进入 LLM 的文本序列，而是通过 cross-attention 层以\\\"外部记忆\\\"形式注入到 LLM 的中间表示中。代表工作：Flamingo（每层插入 cross-att…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) in Mamba-2 Multimodal.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) in Mamba-2 Multimodal\",\"score\":405.6825660104805,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-scan\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Scan\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":46},{\"match\":\"Cross-Scan\",\"offset\":97},{\"match\":\"Cross-Scan\",\"offset\":227},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":1221}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) in Mamba-2 Multimodal\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) 是MVSS模块中的另一种2D扫描策略，将视觉patch特征沿四个对角线方向展开为1D序列并分别送入Mamba-2层处理。四个方向包括：左上→右下、右下→左上、右上→左下、左下→右上。CSM借鉴VMamba的Cross-Scan Module设计思想——对角线方向扫描可以捕获传统行列扫描难以建模的斜向空间关系（如物体的对角线边界、纹理等）。与BSM（2个方向…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture\",\"score\":390.0568102030323,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"modality-\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":55},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":112},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":225},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":264},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":587},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":679},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":724},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":803},{\"match\":\"cross-attentio\",\"offset\":1070},{\"match\":\"cross-attentio\",\"offset\":1113},{\"match\":\"Modality\",\"offset\":1286}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture\\n术语是什么？\\nCross-Attention LMM 是多模态大模型的第二种主流架构，在 LLM backbone 中插入专用 cross-attention layers 处理 image tokens。大部分层保持原有 self-attention（仅处理 text tokens），少数层（如 Llama3.2-11B 中 4/40 层）被替换为 cross-attention layers——text tokens 通过 cross-attention attend to image tokens，…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Modal Cache（模态缓存）.md\",\"basename\":\"Modal Cache（模态缓存）\",\"score\":382.22902916186405,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"modal\",\"modality-specific\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":30},{\"match\":\"modality-specific\",\"offset\":90},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":193},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":310},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":407},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":444},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":491},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":932},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":983},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":1505},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":2040},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":2152},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":2199},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":2261},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":2333},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":2805},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":2925},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":3005},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":3059}],\"excerpt\":\"## Modal Cache（模态缓存）\\n术语是什么？\\nModal Cache 是 EEVEE 提出的面向多模态模型 serving 的模块级中间结果缓存机制，用于存储和复用 modality-specific modules 的推理输出以消除跨请求重复计算。与传统 LLM serving 中仅用于加速 autoregressive decoding 的 KV Cache 不同，Modal Cache 缓存的是跨请求可共享的模块输出——主要是 visual encoder 产生的 visual tokens 或对应的 KV pairs，使后续引用同一图像/视频/音频的请求可直接复用而无需重跑 e…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）.md\",\"basename\":\"MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）\",\"score\":261.9852047756735,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":16},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":1073}],\"excerpt\":\"## MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMMDiT 是 SD3 (Stable Diffusion 3) 提出的多模态 DiT 架构变体。核心设计：文本和视频两种模态共享 self-attention 层进行跨模态交互，但使用各自独立的全连接层和 FFN，以处理两种模态特征在数值尺度和语义空间上的差异。这种\\\"共享注意力 + 独立 FFN/FC\\\"的设计使模型既能实现文本-视频对齐，又能保持各自模态的特征表达能力。EasyAnimate 中文本特征经 RM…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Intra-modality _ Inter-modality Attention Decomposition in VLM KV Cache Pruning.md\",\"basename\":\"Intra-modality _ Inter-modality Attention Decomposition in VLM KV Cache Pruning\",\"score\":176.69892784798122,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross_ratio=0.0\",\"cross_ratio=0.9\",\"cross_ratio=0.5\",\"cross-attention\",\"cross-self\",\"modal\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":26},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":120},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":141},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":350},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":524},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.5\",\"offset\":1169},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.9\",\"offset\":1211},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1230},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.0\",\"offset\":1268},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1350},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":1470},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":1619}],\"excerpt\":\"## Intra-modality / Inter-modality Attention Decomposition in VLM KV Cache Pruning\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nIntra-modality（模态内）和 Inter-modality（跨模态）注意力分解是将多模态 VLM 的注意力矩阵按 token 模态归属进行结构化拆分的技术。给定包含 L_t 个文本 token 和 L_v 个视觉 token 的序列，注意力矩阵 A ∈ R^{L×L} 分解为：\\n- **Intra-modality**：A^{st}（text→text）捕捉文本内语义关系；…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Grounded-DINO.md\",\"basename\":\"Grounded-DINO\",\"score\":66.68314896273405,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention→ffn。支持任意文本类别名作为输入，输出检测bbox和对应类别标签。grounding\",\"cross-attention→ffn\",\"cross-attention→text\",\"cross-attention）；\",\"cross-attention\",\"cross-modality\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"cross-attention）；\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modality\",\"offset\":366},{\"match\":\"cross-attention→text\",\"offset\":414},{\"match\":\"cross-attention→FFN。支持任意文本类别名作为输入，输出检测bbox和对应类别标签。Grounding\",\"offset\":435}],\"excerpt\":\"…**：(1) Feature Enhancer阶段做deep early fusion（deformable self-attention + image-to-text/text-to-image cross-attention）；(2) Language-Guided Query Selection阶段选择与文本最相关的top-Nq图像特征作为decoder queries；(3) Cross-Modality Decoder阶段每层做self-attention→image cross-attention→text cross-attention→FFN。支持任意文本类别名作为输入，输出检测bbox和对应类别标签。Grounding DINO 1.5 Pro使用ViT-L backbone在20M+ grounding images上训练达到SOTA零样本检测性能。\\n从算法pipe…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Hyper Attention Transformer Block (HATB，超注意力Transformer块).md\",\"basename\":\"Hyper Attention Transformer Block (HATB，超注意力Transformer块)\",\"score\":56.36833151012364,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention（文本查询→视觉特征）与\",\"cross-attention\",\"modal\",\"modality-specific，权重初始化自\",\"modality-specific\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"cross-attention（文本查询→视觉特征）与\",\"offset\":224},{\"match\":\"Modality-Specific\",\"offset\":434},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":533},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":655},{\"match\":\"modality-specific，权重初始化自\",\"offset\":1355},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":1628},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":1654},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":1733},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":1743},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":1897},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":2010},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":2632}],\"excerpt\":\"…ansformer Block (HATB) 是 mPLUG-Owl3 提出的轻量级多模态 Transformer 扩展模块。其核心创新在于：在语言模型的 Transformer block 中，将 cross-attention（文本查询→视觉特征）与 self-attention（文本内部）**并行执行**，而非 Flamingo 的串行插入方式。HATB 仅在 LLM 中稀疏替换少量层（如 Qwen2 28 层中的 4 层 [0, 9, 17, 25]），并通过四个关键设计实现高效多模态融合：(1) 共享 LayerNorm——复用 Transformer 原生 LN 同时对文本和视觉特征做归一化；(2) Modality-Specific KV Projection——视觉的 K/V 投影权重用 LLM 预训练 KV 权重初始化（W_img_KV ∈ R^{2D×D}）；(3) 共…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Token Pruning (Prompt-aware Token Pruning).md\",\"basename\":\"Token Pruning (Prompt-aware Token Pruning)\",\"score\":45.428292261525556,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross_modal_i_head\",\"cross_modal_i\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":273},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":279},{\"match\":\"cross_modal_I\",\"offset\":682},{\"match\":\"cross_modal_I\",\"offset\":811},{\"match\":\"cross_modal_I_head\",\"offset\":931}],\"excerpt\":\"…oken magnitude、saliency或visual token间相似度，忽略文本prompt对token重要性的影响。Focus提出的prompt-aware token pruning利用cross-modal attention scores动态识别与当前prompt语义相关的visual tokens，保留semantically important tokens同时prune不相关tokens。Prune掉的tokens在后续P×V计算和下游层中不再加载，实现cumulative computation和memory access节省。保留比例逐层递减（40%→10%），深层layer prune更激进。\\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语，比如术语所在pipeline的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nPrompt-aware tok…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Any-to-Any Multimodal Models.md\",\"basename\":\"Any-to-Any Multimodal Models\",\"score\":44.464101148188,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-modal\",\"cross-stage\",\"modal\",\"modality-specific\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":19},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":57},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":143},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":349},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":