\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":8},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":101},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":277},{\"match\":\"CrossAttention\",\"offset\":691},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":1561}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multimodal Connector / Projector in MLLM\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\n多模态连接器（Multimodal Connector / Projector）是MLLM中位于视觉编码器和LLM之间的模块，负责将视觉特征映射到LLM的embedding空间，并可能对视觉特征进行进一步处理（如序列压缩、空间关系建模）。最简单的连接器是3层MLP（如LLaVA-1.5），更复杂的包括Q-Former（BLIP-2，使用learnable queries通过cross-attention压缩视觉token）、C-Abs…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multilevel Concentration.md\",\"basename\":\"Multilevel Concentration\",\"score\":26.10430236376016,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-modal\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":154},{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":965}],\"excerpt\":\"…tilevel Concentration是Focus论文提出的硬件导向的冗余消除范式，在三个粒度层次上层次化地压缩VLM的视觉-语言输入：(1) Semantic Level (token级)：基于cross-modal attention的语义引导token pruning，保留文本prompt相关的视觉区域；(2) Block Level (spatiotemporal block级)：在2×2×2时空窗口内做localized similarity comparison，限制匹配范围以保持streaming和高局部性；(3) Vector Level (sub-token vector级)：将token embedding切分为32维vectors做细粒度cosine similarity matching，捕获motion引起的partial alignment。三层concen…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Expert Generalization and Specialization in Multimodal MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"Expert Generalization and Specialization in Multimodal MoE\",\"score\":26.038179383592933,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-entropy\",\"modalities\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":189},{\"match\":\"modalities\",\"offset\":332},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":484},{\"match\":\"cross-entropy\",\"offset\":521},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":561},{\"match\":\"modalities\",\"offset\":803},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":845},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":1253},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":1382},{\"match\":\"modalities\",\"offset\":1527},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"off