ic Forgetting in Multimodal MoE Fine-tuning (多模态 MoE 微调中的灾难性遗忘).md\",\"basename\":\"Catastrophic Forgetting in Multimodal MoE Fine-tuning (多模态 MoE 微调中的灾难性遗忘)\",\"score\":19.012929500412355,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross_entropy\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"cross_entropy\",\"offset\":647},{\"match\":\"Modality\",\"offset\":1906}],\"excerpt\":\"loss = cross_entropy(pred, target)\\n            # 所有被选中的 expert FFN 参数都参与更新\\n            W_gate -= lr * ∂loss/∂W_gate   # ← 文本知识所在权重被覆盖\\n            W_up   -= lr * ∂loss/∂W_up     # ← 同前\\n            W_down -= lr * ∂loss/∂W_down   # ← 同前\\n```\\n**遗忘程度对比（基于 Mixtral 8x7B，来自 MoExtend Table 2）：**\\n```\\n方法…\"}],\"totalCount\":45,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"multimodal vision text encoder parallel cross-modal fusion concurrent path:knowledge_notes\"}","structuredContent":{"result":{"mode":"omnisearch","hits":[{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Modal Information Flow in MLLMs.md","basename":"Cross-Modal Information Flow in MLLMs","score":707.2341478849996,"foundWords":["cross","cross-modal显著增加","cross-modal","modal","modal显著增加","modal主导","modal交互为主","modal交互"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":3},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":87},{"match":"Cross-modal","offset":280},{"match":"modal交互为主","offset":399},{"match":"cross-modal","offset":409},{"match":"cross-modal","offset":459},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":644},{"match":"-modal交","offset":965},{"match":"纯cross-moda","offset":985},{"match":"-modal主","offset":1065},{"match":"cross-modal显著增","offset":1106},{"match":"Cross-Moda","offset":1158},{"match":"（moda","offset":1409},{"match":"Cross-Moda","offset":1473},{"match":"imoda","offset":1545}],"excerpt":"## Cross-Modal Information Flow in MLLMs\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nCross-Modal Information Flow（跨模态信息流）指MLLM的Transformer层中不同模态token（visual和text）之间的attention交互模式和强度。在MLLM的每一层attention计算中，QK^T attention矩阵包含四个block：visual→visual、visual→text、text→visual、text→text。Cross-modal attention s…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵).md","basename":"Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵)","score":670.9870325327383,"foundWords":["cross","cross-modal","modal","modality"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":3},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":74},{"match":"modality","offset":896},{"match":"nt Mu","offset":1967}],"excerpt":"## Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\nCross-Modal Attention Entropy 是 MEDA 提出的用于量化多模态 LLM 每层跨模态注意力分布特性的度量指标。它通过同时计算文本→视觉（T→V）和视觉→文本（V→T）两个方向的注意力熵，捕捉该层对跨模态 token pair 的注意力集中/分散程度。公式为：\n$$E_{CM}^l = -(E_{TV}^l + E_{VT}^l)$$\n其中：\n$$E_{TV}^l = \\frac{1}{|T|} \\sum_{i=1}^{n…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-modal Fusion in LLM Layers (LLM 层的跨模态融合).md","basename":"Cross-modal Fusion in LLM Layers (LLM 层的跨模态融合)","score":632.6969351772282,"foundWords":["cross","cross-modal","modal"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-modal","offset":3},{"match":"Cross-modal","offset":81},{"match":"cross-modal","offset":220},{"match":"Cross-modal","offset":550},{"match":"Cross-modal","offset":611},{"match":"Cross-modal","offset":1377},{"match":"Modal","offset":1610}],"excerpt":"## Cross-modal Fusion in LLM Layers (LLM 层的跨模态融合)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\nCross-modal Fusion in LLM Layers 是多模态 LLM 中 visual tokens 和 text tokens 在 Transformer 层中通过 Self-Attention 进行信息交互的过程。AIM 通过消融实验发现：LLM 的不同层对 cross-modal fusion 的需求差异显著——早期层依赖 visual tokens 建立视觉-文本对齐（跨模态融合阶段），后期层主要进行 text-onl…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention for Multi-Modal Fusion (交叉注意力多模态融合).md","basename":"Cross-Attention for Multi-Modal Fusion (交叉注意力多模态融合)","score":621.7818124079969,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention","modal"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Attention","offset":3},{"match":"Modal","offset":29},{"match":"Cross-Attention","offset":61},{"match":"Cross-Attention","offset":170},{"match":"Cross-Attention","offset":278},{"match":"FC 矩阵\n\nCross-at","offset":488},{"match":"ainMoE Cross-At","offset":686},{"match":"合\n- 不同于标准 cross","offset":1645}],"excerpt":"## Cross-Attention for Multi-Modal Fusion (交叉注意力多模态融合)\n术语解释\nCross-Attention 是 Transformer 架构中的一种注意力机制变体，其中 Query 来自一个模态/序列，Key 和 Value 来自另一个模态/序列，实现跨模态信息交互。在 BrainMoE 中，Cross-Attention 用于将原始 FC 矩阵（结构信息）融合到 cognition embeddings（语义信息）中。\n术语是什么？\n标准 Self-Attention: Q, K, V 来自同一输入。Cross-Attention: Q 来自一个源，…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Three-Stage Cross-Modal Interaction in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型三阶段跨模态交互）.md","basename":"Three-Stage Cross-Modal Interaction in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型三阶段跨模态交互）","score":621.5202498255464,"foundWords":["cross","cross/self-attention；","crossattn","cross-attention","cross-attn","cross-modal","modal"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":15},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":538},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":1098},{"match":"Cross-attention","offset":1269},{"match":"CrossAttn","offset":1356},{"match":"cross-attn","offset":1379},{"match":"Cross-attention","offset":1735},{"match":"CrossAttn","offset":1853},{"match":"CrossAttn","offset":2254},{"match":"cross-attn","offset":2277},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":2417},{"match":"cross/self-attention；","offset":3052},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":3324},{"match":"modal","offset":3364}],"excerpt":"## Three-Stage Cross-Modal Interaction in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型三阶段跨模态交互）\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nVisiPruner (EMNLP 2025) 通过系统消融实验揭示的 MLLM 内部跨模态信息处理的三阶段规律。该框架将 MLLM 的 32 层 transformer 按功能分为三个阶段：(1) **Shallow Layers（浅层，layer 1-8）— Task Recognition**：视觉和文本 token 在浅层独立演化，无有意义的跨模态融合。文本 token 的 hidden stat…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Memory Recall via Cross-Modal Attention（基于跨模态注意力的记忆召回）.md","basename":"Memory Recall via Cross-Modal Attention（基于跨模态注意力的记忆召回）","score":614.5856563595426,"foundWords":["cross","cross-modal","modal"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":21},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":121},{"match":"cross-modal","offset":273},{"match":"modal","offset":1345}],"excerpt":"## Memory Recall v