Buffer _ 片上注意力缓冲区（On-Chip KV Cache）\",\"score\":577.0049920034285,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-chip\",\"chip\",\"chip避免了gpu方案中hbm访问的高功耗\",\"chip容量溢出时\",\"chip容量不足时才将多余kv条目卸载到hbm\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":10},{\"match\":\"On-Chip\",\"offset\":31},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":64},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":122},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":253},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":274},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":321},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":369},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":398},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":489},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":505},{\"match\":\"chip\",\"offset\":539},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":597},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":604},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":616},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":631},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":712},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":784},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":837},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":913},{\"match\":\"chip\",\"offset\":938},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":978}],\"excerpt\":\"## Attention Buffer / 片上注意力缓冲区（On-Chip KV Cache）\\n术语是什么？\\nAttention Buffer是HNLPU芯片内专用于存储KV Cache的SRAM模块。每个芯片配备320MB Attention Buffer，由20,000个bank组成（每bank 16KB），采用1W1R（一写一读）端口配置和32-bit访问宽度。该Buffer在worst-case PVT条件下维持80 TB/s带宽和3-cycle延迟。主要功能是作为芯片所分配attention groups的KV Cache，仅在on-chip容量不足时才将多余KV条目卸载到HBM。\\n从硬件架构角度…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Stream Decoder _ On-the-Fly Dequantization（流式解码器 _ 在线解量化）.md\",\"basename\":\"Stream Decoder _ On-the-Fly Dequantization（流式解码器 _ 在线解量化）\",\"score\":267.4584229920189,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-the-fly\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"On-the-Fly\",\"offset\":20},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":43},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":121},{\"match\":\"chip\",\"offset\":124},{\"match\":\"on-the-fly\",\"offset\":162},{\"match\":\"chip\",\"offset\":261},{\"match\":\"chip\",\"offset\":280},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":324},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":363},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":369},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":745},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":798},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":997},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1029},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1035},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1145},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1319},{\"match\":\"on-the-fly\",\"offset\":1452},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1475},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1560}],\"excerpt\":\"## Stream Decoder / On-the-Fly Dequantization（流式解码器 / 在线解量化）\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nStream Decoder是RPU论文提出的硬件模块，用于在权重数据从on-chip buffer流入compute pipeline的传输过程中实时（on-the-fly）将压缩的block-quantized weight tiles（BFP/MxFP/NxFP, 4-8 bit）解码还原为BF16标准精度。这使权重可以以压缩格式存储在off-chip HBM-CO中（减少off-chip capacity和energy），但计算仍以BF16 full pre…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Synchronous Dataflow Execution on GPUs.md\",\"basename\":\"Synchronous Dataflow Execution on GPUs\",\"score\":218.97804138752878,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-chip\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":31},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":34},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":56},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":78},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":125},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":185},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":226},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":284},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":409},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":933},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":990},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1161},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1627},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1731},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2054},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2057}],\"excerpt\":\"## Synchronous Dataflow Execution on GPUs\\n术语是什么？\\nSynchronous Dataflow Execution 是一种 GPU 执行模型，将 DL 计算图中的不同算子映射到不同 CTA，通过片上队列（on-chip queue）传递 tile 级中间数据，使多个算子在不同 SM 上 **空间并发**（spatial concurrency）执行，而非 BSP 的串行执行或 Vertical Fusion 的时间复用（temporal multiplexing）。在 Kitsune 的形式定义中，属于 synchronous dataflow（SDF）：当数据到达…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Bulk-Synchronous Programming (BSP) on GPUs.md\",\"basename\":\"Bulk-Synchronous Programming (BSP) on GPUs\",\"score\":210.20748408037565,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-chip\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":14},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":38},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":65},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":643},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":655},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1197},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1230},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1260},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1310},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1332},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1375},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1441},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1469},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1603},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1652},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1781},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1784}],\"excerpt\":\"## Bulk-Synchronous Programming (BSP) on GPUs\\n术语是什么？\\nBulk-Synchronous Programming (BSP) 是 GPU 默认的执行模型：每个 DL 算子映射为单个 CUDA kernel，一个 kernel 独占 GPU，所有 CTA 完成后 global barrier，再 launch 下一个 kernel。源自 Leslie Valiant 的 BSP 并行计算模型（1990），GPU 采用简化版：每个 kernel 的 CTA 独立执行到完成 → implicit global barrier → 下一个 kernel。现代 GPU 虽通过 C…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Shared-memory Hash Table on GPU.md\",\"basename\":\"Shared-memory Hash Table on GPU\",\"score\":209.6598941584703,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-chip\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":28},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":92},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":256},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":273},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":293},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":543},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":575},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":585},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":736},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":755},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1163},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1468},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1652},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1703},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2143},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2154},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2261},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2285},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2339},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2359},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2486},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2794},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2841},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2844}],\"excerpt\":\"## Shared-memory Hash Table on GPU\\n术语是什么？\\nGPU shared-memory hash table (共享内存哈希表) 是一种将 GPU on-chip shared memory 作为显式管理的哈希表 scratchpad 的技术。与依赖 L1/L2 cache 的 implicit caching 不同，programmer 直接在 shared memory 中分配 key-value 数组，通过哈希函数和 probing 策略实现 lock-free concurrent insertion/lookup/accumulation。每个 CTA (Cooperative Thread Array…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/LUT-based Dequantization and Softmax on NPU Vector Units.md\",\"basename\":\"LUT-based Dequantization and Softmax on NPU Vector Units\",\"score\":197.89653065901842,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-chip\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":25},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":40},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":103},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":191},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":246},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":820},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":823},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1245},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1424},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1433},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1870},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1964},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2090},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2100}],\"excerpt\":\"## LUT-based Dequantization and Softmax on NPU Vector Units\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nLUT-based computation在NPU上使用向量单元的查表指令替代复杂数学计算，克服NPU向量单元通用计算能力弱、缺乏专用数学函数单元的瓶颈。论文两项LUT技术：(1) LUT dequantization：HVX的vlut16指令将4-bit INT4直接查表映射为FP16，避免传统mask-unpack-convert多指令序列；(2) LUT Softmax：HVX的vgather指令从预计算64KiB FP16 exp LUT收集值，替代多项式exp2展开，…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术).md\",\"basename\":\"System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术)\",\"score\":160.1451968054356,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":10},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":100},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":183},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":192},{\"match\":\"chip\",\"offset\":246},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1321},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1330},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1842},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2559}],\"excerpt\":\"## System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSystem-on-Wafer (SoW) 是 TSMC 的晶圆级封装技术，将多个 compute die 和 HBM die 直接集成在单个硅晶圆上，通过 Local Silicon Interconnect (LSI) 和 XSR SerDes 实现 die-to-die 互联。与传统的 multi-chip module (MCM) 或 2.5D interposer 方案（如 CoWoS）相比，SoW 的显著差异在于 sc…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Channel Dependency Graph (CDG) for Multi-Chiplet NoC _ 多芯粒NoC的通道依赖图.md\",\"basename\":\"Channel Dependency Graph (CDG) for Multi-Chiplet NoC _ 多芯粒NoC的通道依赖图\",\"score\":120.3814312989783,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"chip\",\"chiplet-to-interposer\",\"chiplet-interposer-chiplet\",\"chiplet\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":44},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":121},{\"match\":\"Chip\",\"offset\":124},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":280},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":311},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":353},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":374},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":428},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":439},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":501},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":603},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":661},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":687},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":711},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":811},{\"match\":\"chiplet-interposer-chiplet\",\"offset\":853},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":926},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":963},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":999},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1003},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1308},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1312},{\"match\":\"chiplet-to-interposer\",\"offset\":1322},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1470},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1551},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1568},{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":1625},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1644},{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":1655}],\"excerpt\":\"## Channel Dependency Graph (CDG) for Multi-Chiplet NoC / 多芯粒NoC的通道依赖图\\n术语是什么？\\nChannel Dependency Graph (CDG) 是 Network-on-Chip 死锁分析的核心理论工具，最初由 Dally 和 Seitz 提出。CDG 以 NoC 中的物理或虚拟通道（channel/VC）为节点，以路由函数定义的连续通道间依赖关系为有向边，构成有向图。NoC 死锁的经典充要条件是：路由算法是 deadlock-free 当且仅当 CDG 无环。在 multi-chiplet NoC 场景中，deadlock 环可以跨越 chiplet 内部 NoC 和 interposer NoC 的…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FlashAttention (IO-Aware Exact Attention with Tiling and Online Softmax).md\",\"basename\":\"FlashAttention (IO-Aware Exact Attention with Tiling and Online Softmax)\",\"score\":115.96060043194579,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-chip\",\"online\",\"ones\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":41},{\"match\":\"Online\",\"offset\":60},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":119},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":176},{\"match\":\"online\",\"offset\":194},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":241},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":292},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":319},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":341},{\"match\":\"online\",\"offset\":372},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":473},{\"match\":\"online\",\"offset\":485},{\"match\":\"ones\",\"offset\":763},{\"match\":\"online\",\"offset\":1056},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1357},{\"match\":\"Online\",\"offset\":1412},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1471},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1526},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1641},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1735},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1754},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1798},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1873},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1888},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1911},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1929},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1999},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2106},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2200},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2329},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2399},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2404},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2466}],\"excerpt\":\"## FlashAttention (IO-Aware Exact Attention with Tiling and Online Softmax)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nFlashAttention（Dao et al., 2022; Dao, 2024）是一种 IO-aware exact attention 算法，通过 tiling 和 online softmax 将注意力计算融合为单 pass 操作，避免将中间 attention matrix（$S = QK^T$，大小为 $O(L^2)$）写回 HBM。标准 attention 需要三次 HBM 往返，FlashAtt…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_no