ch\":\"on\",\"offset\":460},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":499},{\"match\":\"on-chip\",\"offset\":1035},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1285},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1579},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1632},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1661},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1676},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1724},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1746},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1844},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1885},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1922}],\"excerpt\":\"## FlashAttention\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nFlashAttention（Dao et al., 2022, 2023）是一种 IO-aware 的精确注意力计算 fused kernel。传统 attention 计算需要物化完整的 N×N attention matrix（O(N²) 内存），而 FlashAttention 通过分 tile（tiling）和在线 softmax（online softmax）技术，在不物化完整 attention matrix 的情况下计算精确的 attention 输出，将内存访问从 O(N²) 降…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）.md\",\"basename\":\"FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）\",\"score\":18.696234864219626,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-chip\",\"online\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":99},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":183},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":299},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":333},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":367},{\"match\":\"online\",\"offset\":401},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":518},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":617},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":643},{\"match\":\"On-chip\",\"offset\":1142},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1159},{\"match\":\"Online\",\"offset\":1417},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1597},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1606},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1871},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1925},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2050},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2077},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2185},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2266},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2415},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2497},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2528},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2743},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2829}],\"excerpt\":\"## FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）\\n术语是