 精确注意力 CUDA kernel，通过 tiling 和 recomputation 技术避免将完整的 $N \\times N$ 注意力中间矩阵（softmax 的输入和输出）写入 GPU HBM，将 HBM 访问量从 $O(N^2)$ 降至 $O(N)$。核心洞察：GPU 的 SRAM 带宽（~20TB/s on A100）远高于 HBM…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Dynamic KV Cache Retrieval Engine (DRE)（动态KV缓存检索引擎）.md","basename":"Dynamic KV Cache Retrieval Engine (DRE)（动态KV缓存检索引擎）","score":17.73590768926306,"foundWords":["on","on-chip","chip"],"matches":[{"match":"on","offset":203},{"match":"on","offset":243},{"match":"on","offset":333},{"match":"on","offset":406},{"match":"on","offset":412},{"match":"on","offset":545},{"match":"on","offset":580},{"match":"on-chip","offset":1266},{"match":"on","offset":1490},{"match":"on","offset":1931},{"match":"on","offset":2078},{"match":"on-chip","offset":2137},{"match":"on","offset":2183},{"match":"on","offset":2220},{"match":"on","offset":2242},{"match":"on","offset":2291},{"match":"on","offset":2328},{"match":"on","offset":2393},{"match":"on","offset":2989},{"match":"on","offset":3046},{"match":"on","offset":3229}],"excerpt":"…rieval Engine）是V-Rex提出的专用硬件加速单元，用于offload streaming video LLM中KV cache retrieval的irregular computation和memory management。DRE与LXE（LLM Execution Engine，基于LPU架构的DPE+VPE矩阵/向量计算单元）共同组成V-Rex accelerator。DRE包含两大子模块：KVPU（KV Cache Prediction Unit，集成HCU+WTU）和KVMU（KV Cache Management Unit）。核心设计理念：将ReSV算法中GPU不擅长的conditional/data-dependent操作（bit-level clustering、early-exit thresholding）和irregular memory access…"}],"totalCount":50,"truncated":true},"effectiveQuery":"on-chip memory partitioning SM allocation concurrent scheduling hardware concurrency path:knowledge_notes"}}}
