,{"match":"topology信息（哪些GPU在同一节点）","offset":1424},{"match":"to","offset":1705}],"excerpt":"## Hierarchical All-to-All\n术语解释\n分层All-to-All是针对MoE Expert Parallelism的通信优化策略，将全局All-to-All拆分为intra-node（节点内高带宽）和inter-node（节点间低带宽）两个层次，充分利用两级带宽。\n术语是什么？\n传统All-to-All允许所有GPU直接相互通信，带宽使用效率低。分层All-to-All的关键洞察：\n- 同节点GPU通过NVLink/NVSwitch互联，带宽极高（~900GB/s）\n- 跨节点GPU通过InfiniBand/RoCE互联，带宽相对较低（~200GB/s）\n- 应先在同节点内聚合数据，再跨节点传输，…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hierarchical AlltoAll Communication (层次化AlltoAll通信 _ Resource-Aware Communication).md","basename":"Hierarchical AlltoAll Communication (层次化AlltoAll通信 _ Resource-Aware Communication)","score":1246.3101625705522,"foundWords":["all","alltoall**——将各节点中同一","alltoall**——利用","alltoall，同","alltoall","allto","all通信","to","tokens_per_expert","tokens"],"matches":[{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":16},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":43},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":144},{"match":"all","offset":183},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":194},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":225},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":297},{"match":"AlltoAll**——利用","offset":336},{"match":"AlltoAll**——将各节点中同一","offset":442},{"match":"AlltoAll，同","offset":522},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":614},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":713},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":847},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":1140},{"match":"tokens_per_expert","offset":1149},{"match":"to","offset":1236},{"match":"tokens","offset":1248},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":1311},{"match":"to","offset":1325},{"match":"all","offset":1453},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":1499},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":1720},{"match":"AlltoAll","offset":1835},{"match":"to","offset":1902}],"excerpt":"## Hierarchical AlltoAll Communication (层次化AlltoAll通信 / Resource-Aware Communication)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nHierarchical AlltoAll 是 MoESys 针对 MoE 模型中 Expert Parallelism 的 AlltoAll 通信提出的两阶段网络拓扑感知通信优化。传统 AlltoAll 中，不同 rank 的 GPU 跨节点通信时经过 spine switch，造成路由冲突和带宽浪费。Hierarchical AlltoAll 将一次全交换拆为两个…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识