\",\"offset\":1171},{\"match\":\"top-\",\"offset\":1179},{\"match\":\"top-\",\"offset\":1187},{\"match\":\"toke\",\"offset\":1203},{\"match\":\"top-\",\"offset\":1223},{\"match\":\"toke\",\"offset\":1235},{\"match\":\"all-to-al\",\"offset\":1269},{\"match\":\"Top-\",\"offset\":1305},{\"match\":\"*Token-leve\",\"offset\":1907},{\"match\":\"toke\",\"offset\":1937},{\"match\":\"toke\",\"offset\":2083},{\"match\":\"（Toke\",\"offset\":2139},{\"match\":\"Token/Toke\",\"offset\":2192}],\"excerpt\":\"## Top-K Routing / Gating Mechanism\\n术语解释\\nTop-K路由是MoE模型中最常用的专家选择策略，对每个token选择门控概率最高的K个专家进行处理，其余专家不参与计算。\\n术语是什么？\\n路由（Gating/Routing）机制决定每个输入token应该激活哪些专家。Top-K路由的具体计算过程：\\n1. 门控网络：θ = Softmax(R(x))，R通常是线性层W_r·x\\n2. Top-K选择：E_selected = TopK(θ, K)，保留概率最高的K个\\n3. 稀疏化：将未选中专家的权重置零，仅K/N的专家参与计算\\nK的典型取值为1~8。K=1（top-…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Gradient-AllReduce in MoE Training.md\",\"basename\":\"Gradient-AllReduce in MoE Training\",\"score\":337.63214101356886,\"foundWords\":[\"all\",\"allgather,\",\"allgather\",\"allreduce\",\"alltoall,\",\"alltoall\",\"allto\",\"all-reduce\",\"to\",\"torch.matmul\",\"torch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"AllReduce\",\"offset\":12},{\"match\":\"AllReduce\",\"offset\":93},{\"match\":\"AllReduce\",\"offset\":143},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":162},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":204},{\"match\":\"AllReduce\",\"offset\":249},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":417},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":681},{\"match\":\"yTorc\",\"offset\":846},{\"match\":\"`al\",\"offset\":859},{\"match\":\"-AllReduc\",\"offset\":1218},{\"match\":\"all-reduc\",\"offset\":1252},{\"match\":\"in [Allto\",\"offset\":1710},{\"match\":\"ll, AllGat\",\"offset\":1720},{\"match\":\"er, AllRe\",\"offset\":1746},{\"match\":\"11; Allt\",\"offset\":2035},{\"match\":\"-7; AllGa\",\"offset\":2066},{\"match\":\"-7; AllRe\",\"offset\":2134},{\"match\":\"s + torch.ma\",\"offset\":2229}],\"excerpt\":\"## Gradient-AllReduce in MoE Training\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nGradient-AllReduce 是数据并行（DP）中梯度同步的集合通信操作。在混合并行训练中，Gradient-AllReduce 为节点间通信，与 AlltoAll 共享 InfiniBand 带宽。若不加优化，会与 MoE 层的 AlltoAll 争用网络导致额外延迟。FSMoE 的自适应梯度分区将 Gradient-AllReduce 与 MoE 层协同设计，最大化隐藏梯度同步开销。\\n从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kerne…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/IpcSafeAllocator.md\",\"basename\":\"IpcSafeAllocator\",\"score\":336.24007948795116,\"foundWords\":[\"allocate\",\"allocator。在\",\"allocator\",\"torchcachingallocator\",\"torch.ones\",\"torch.empty\",\"torch.full\",\"torch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Allocator\",\"offset\":10},{\"match\":\"Allocator\",\"offset\":36},{\"match\":\"Torch\",\"offset\":66},{\"match\":\"Torch\",\"offset\":83},{\"match\":\"TorchCachingAllocator\",\"offset\":94},{\"match\":\"Torch\",\"offset\":153},{\"match\":\"Allocator\",\"offset\":207},{\"match\":\"torch.ones\",\"offset\":221},{\"match\":\"torch.empty\",\"offset\":236},{\"match\":\"torch.full\",\"offset\":252},{\"match\":\"Allocator\",\"offset\":388},{\"match\":\"Allocator\",\"offset\":417},{\"match\":\"allocate\",\"offset\":436},{\"match\":\"Torch\",\"offset\":665},{\"match\":\"torch.ones\",\"offset\":676},{\"match\":\"Allocator\",\"offset\":717},{\"match\":\"torch.empty\",\"offset\":730},{\"match\":\"torch.full\",\"offset\":758},{\"match\":\"Allocator\",\"offset\":799},{\"match\":\"allocator。在\",\"offset\":992}],\"excerpt\":\"## IpcSafeAllocator\\n术语是什么？\\nIpcSafeAllocator 是 ElasticMoE 自定义的 PyTorch 内存分配器，覆盖 PyTorch 默认的 `TorchCachingAllocator`，确保所有模型权重分配使用 CANN 的 IPC 兼容内存标记。标准 PyTorch 分配器使用设备内存池，分配结果通常作为单一内存块管理，无法被跨进程 IPC 共享。IpcSafeAllocator 拦截 `torch.ones()`、`torch.empty()`、`torch.full()` 等核心分配函数，直接调用 IPC 兼容的 `aclrtMalloc`，使分配的张量可被…\"}],\"totalCount\":50,\"truncated\":true},\"effectiveQuery\":\"computation communication overlap MoE DualPipe all-to-all hiding behind compute path:knowledge_notes\"}","structuredContent":{"result":{"mode":"omnisearch","hits":[{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Irregular All-to-All (All-to-Allv) for MoE Partitionin