- Multimodal parallel encoding → heterogeneous compute unit mapping\n- Video spatial-temporal parallel → memory bandwidth pressure\n\nSecondary (software/algorithm):\n- Algorithm-level concurrency analysis\n- DAG dependency analysis\n\nLet me structure the answer:\n\n## Q1.4 — 单请求场景下多算子/微算子并发算法可行性\n\n### 笔记证据概览 (table)\n\n### 1. 方法细节（硬件数据流 + 计算/控制模块设计 + 架构）— PRIMARY\n\n#### 1.1 MoE Expert FFN 并发与 All-to-All 通信重叠\n- Method details with pseudo-code showing expert parallel computation\n- Hardware requirements: NVLink bandwidth, SM partitioning, on-chip buffer\n- PROBE's Phase-Locked Co-Scheduling\n- DeepSeek-V3's DualPipe computation-communication overlap\n\n#### 1.2 DiT Denoising Step 内部的 Attention Head 与 FFN 并发\n- DiT block structure: adaLN → attention → FFN sequential\n- Multi-head attention: all heads can be computed in parallel (embarrassingly parallel)\n- Between steps: strict sequential dependency (denoising is autoregressive in time)\n- Hardware: Tensor Core utilization for batch-MHA, TMA for data movement\n\n#### 1.3 多模态 Vision + Text Encoder 并行编码与跨模态融合并发\n- Vision encoder and text encoder are independent → fully parallelizable\n- Cross-modal fusion: HATB parallel self+ cross attention\n- Hardware: heterogeneous compute unit mapping\n\n#### 1.4 Video Spatial + Temporal Stream 并行处理\n- Frame/patch independent encoding → data parallel\n- Spatial and temporal attention can be factorized and pipelined\n- Hardware: memory bandwidth for multi-frame KV cache\n\n### 2. 数据依赖 DAG 分析（算法层面并发/串行判断）\n\n### 3. 并发对硬件体系结构的要求\n- Parallel compute unit count (SM/CU/Tensor Core)\n- On-chip memory partitioning (shared memory, register file)\n- Control logic for dynamic concurrent scheduling (warp scheduler, TMA)\n- Memory bandwidth requirements\n\n### 4. 实现（辅助说明）\n- Frameworks and toolchains\n\n### 5. 实验环境（辅助说明）\n\n### 6. 方法对比表\n\n### 7. 不确定性\n\nNow let me write this comprehensive answer. The answer must be ≥100 lines and in Chinese.","signature":"39227aa4-8812-4af6-86e8-72a74006c86